leging corporate waste, unjust enrichment and that such board members breached their fiduciary duties by approving the stock-based compensation plan awarded to Elon Musk in 2018 (the “2018 CEO Performance Award”).\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"53a58b6ddaf18ba7\">>>", "siteName": "www.sec.gov"}]}, "isError": false, "timestamp": 1775622383365}}
